Package: knhanesget
Title: 安装和更新 knhanes
Version: 0.1.0.5
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Heng", family = "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lh1399780@163.com")
Description: Provides a lightweight public installer for knhanes. It creates
    a random installation request code compatible with knhanes, obtains
    short-lived download sessions from the official authorization server,
    verifies versioned release archives, and supports activation, version
    checks, updates, and local deactivation. It contains no KNHANES data,
    knhanes analysis code, long-lived server credential, or private signing
    key.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
